  "summary": "ATXN7L3-related developmental delay, hypotonia and facial dysmorphism has a confidence assertion of moderate based on 1 curated publication. This is a monoallelic autosomal condition. This is typically de novo. Variant consequence is altered gene product structure (inferred), decreased gene product level (evidence) and altered gene product level (evidence). Molecular mechanism is loss of function (evidenced by protein expression function and patient cells functional alteration). Recorded variant types include frameshift variant, stop gained and missense variant.",
